  "slug": "plain-pasta",
  "name": "Plain Pasta",
  "recipe_type": null,
  "brief_description": "Real old fashioned homemade pasta. The salt, baking powder and butter are optional. Also, try substituting 1/2 cup milk or 3 beaten eggs for the warm water.",
  "cuisine": null,
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mix together flour, salt baking powder. Add warm water and butter; knead dough until stiff. Let rest a few minutes. Roll into a ball and quarter. Using 1/4 of the ball at a time roll out to 1/8 or 1/16 inch thick. Cut into desired shapes. Let dry for 1 to 3 hours on flat surface. Cook as you would pasta"
    }
  ],
